IMPORT prelude
IMPORT daydate
IMPORT `bkv-law`
IMPORT `bkv-worker-law`
IMPORT `bkv-worker-seat`

-- Tests for the worker seat: is a disease a listed occupational disease (BKV § 1(1), Anlage 1 No. 1322)? Expected values are written from the deposited German text, not from this encoding's output:
-- the entry's words in the gazette (bgbl-2026-i-210 lines 25-26), Art. 2 (in force 1 August 2026, line 33), BKV § 1(1) (bkv-1 line 2), and the Zitiergebot of BVerfG 2 BvF 3/90 para. 158 for the second reading.
-- Columns of `Case of a worker with a disease`: 1 the disease; 2 caused by pesticides; 3 applied over many years; 4 applied often; 5 applied by the worker; 6 part of insured work; 7 the date of the request.
-- P is `Parkinson syndrome`; the row is the case in the column order. The first column is a Parkinson syndrome and the other facts are as the entry needs them unless a row says otherwise.

§ `The entry on a Parkinson syndrome, with the Regulation standing`

--                                                                                                                                                      1                     2      3      4      5      6      7
-- all conditions met, on 1 August 2026, the day the Regulation comes into force (Art. 2): listed
#ASSERT `the disease is a listed occupational disease under the reading` `the Seventh Amending Regulation stands` (`Case of a worker with a disease` OF `Parkinson syndrome`, TRUE,  TRUE,  TRUE,  TRUE,  TRUE,  (Date 1 8 2026)) EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- the day before: the list has no entry yet
#ASSERT `the disease is a listed occupational disease under the reading` `the Seventh Amending Regulation stands` (`Case of a worker with a disease` OF `Parkinson syndrome`, TRUE,  TRUE,  TRUE,  TRUE,  TRUE,  (Date 31 7 2026)) EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- a later day: listed
#ASSERT `the disease is a listed occupational disease under the reading` `the Seventh Amending Regulation stands` (`Case of a worker with a disease` OF `Parkinson syndrome`, TRUE,  TRUE,  TRUE,  TRUE,  TRUE,  (Date 1 1 2027)) EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- not caused by pesticides: the entry says 'durch'
#ASSERT `the disease is a listed occupational disease under the reading` `the Seventh Amending Regulation stands` (`Case of a worker with a disease` OF `Parkinson syndrome`, FALSE, TRUE,  TRUE,  TRUE,  TRUE,  (Date 1 8 2026)) EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- not over many years: 'langjährig'
#ASSERT `the disease is a listed occupational disease under the reading` `the Seventh Amending Regulation stands` (`Case of a worker with a disease` OF `Parkinson syndrome`, TRUE,  FALSE, TRUE,  TRUE,  TRUE,  (Date 1 8 2026)) EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- not often: 'häufig'
#ASSERT `the disease is a listed occupational disease under the reading` `the Seventh Amending Regulation stands` (`Case of a worker with a disease` OF `Parkinson syndrome`, TRUE,  TRUE,  FALSE, TRUE,  TRUE,  (Date 1 8 2026)) EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- not applied by the worker: 'selbst angewendete'
#ASSERT `the disease is a listed occupational disease under the reading` `the Seventh Amending Regulation stands` (`Case of a worker with a disease` OF `Parkinson syndrome`, TRUE,  TRUE,  TRUE,  FALSE, TRUE,  (Date 1 8 2026)) EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- the pesticide use was not part of insured work: BKV § 1(1) 'infolge einer den Versicherungsschutz ... begründenden Tätigkeit'
#ASSERT `the disease is a listed occupational disease under the reading` `the Seventh Amending Regulation stands` (`Case of a worker with a disease` OF `Parkinson syndrome`, TRUE,  TRUE,  TRUE,  TRUE,  FALSE, (Date 1 8 2026)) EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- another disease: not covered by this encoding, which is not the same as no
#ASSERT `the disease is a listed occupational disease under the reading` `the Seventh Amending Regulation stands` (`Case of a worker with a disease` OF `another disease`,    TRUE,  TRUE,  TRUE,  TRUE,  TRUE,  (Date 1 8 2026)) EQUALS NOTHING

§ `The same cases if the whole Seventh Amending Regulation is void`

-- 'Nichtigkeit der Verordnung' (BVerfG 2 BvF 3/90 para. 158) read of the whole Regulation: the entry was never in force, so no date makes the disease listed. Reading F2(b); the stronger view is that the entry stands (NOTES.md, F14).
--                                                                                                                                                                  1                     2      3      4      5      6      7
-- on 1 August 2026: not listed
#ASSERT `the disease is a listed occupational disease under the reading` `the Seventh Amending Regulation is void as a whole` (`Case of a worker with a disease` OF `Parkinson syndrome`, TRUE,  TRUE,  TRUE,  TRUE,  TRUE,  (Date 1 8 2026)) EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- on a later day: still not listed
#ASSERT `the disease is a listed occupational disease under the reading` `the Seventh Amending Regulation is void as a whole` (`Case of a worker with a disease` OF `Parkinson syndrome`, TRUE,  TRUE,  TRUE,  TRUE,  TRUE,  (Date 1 1 2027)) EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- another disease: not covered
#ASSERT `the disease is a listed occupational disease under the reading` `the Seventh Amending Regulation is void as a whole` (`Case of a worker with a disease` OF `another disease`,    TRUE,  TRUE,  TRUE,  TRUE,  TRUE,  (Date 1 8 2026)) EQUALS NOTHING

§ `The entry's date and its description`

-- Art. 2: 'Diese Verordnung tritt am 1. August 2026 in Kraft.'
#ASSERT `entry No. 1322 of Anlage 1 BKV is in force on the day under the reading` `the Seventh Amending Regulation stands` (Date 1 8 2026)
#ASSERT NOT (`entry No. 1322 of Anlage 1 BKV is in force on the day under the reading` `the Seventh Amending Regulation stands` (Date 31 7 2026))
#ASSERT NOT (`entry No. 1322 of Anlage 1 BKV is in force on the day under the reading` `the Seventh Amending Regulation is void as a whole` (Date 1 1 2030))
-- The entry's words: a Parkinson syndrome from pesticides applied over many years, often, and by the worker.
#ASSERT `entry No. 1322 of Anlage 1 BKV describes the disease` (`Case of a worker with a disease` OF `Parkinson syndrome`, TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, FALSE, (Date 1 8 2026))
#ASSERT NOT (`entry No. 1322 of Anlage 1 BKV describes the disease` (`Case of a worker with a disease` OF `Parkinson syndrome`, TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, FALSE, TRUE, (Date 1 8 2026)))
#ASSERT NOT (`entry No. 1322 of Anlage 1 BKV describes the disease` (`Case of a worker with a disease` OF `another disease`, TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, (Date 1 8 2026)))

§ `The power for the new entry, and the power for the § 9(5) change`

-- The preamble cites § 9(1) sentences 1 and 2 SGB VII (bgbl-2026-i-210 lines 12-14): the power to designate diseases. That is the premise of the severability view (NOTES.md, F14).
#ASSERT `the preamble of the Seventh Amending Regulation cites the power to list a disease`
#ASSERT `the power needed to list a disease` EQUALS `SGB VII 9(1) sentences 1 and 2`
-- The contrast the article draws: the same preamble does not cite § 9(1a) sentence 4, the power it says the § 9(5) change needs (bkv-law.l4).
#ASSERT NOT (`the preamble cites the power` `the power needed to make the confidentiality rule` `the powers cited in the preamble of the Seventh Amending Regulation`)

§ `The seat`

-- Arguments to the first two questions, in order: the disease, caused by pesticides, many years, often, applied by myself, in insured work, the date.
#ASSERT `is my disease a listed occupational disease with the Seventh Amending Regulation in force` `Parkinson syndrome` TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE (Date 1 8 2026) EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `is my disease a listed occupational disease with the Seventh Amending Regulation in force` `Parkinson syndrome` TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE (Date 31 7 2026) EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `is my disease a listed occupational disease with the Seventh Amending Regulation in force` `Parkinson syndrome` TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE TRUE (Date 1 8 2026) EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `is my disease a listed occupational disease with the Seventh Amending Regulation in force` `another disease` TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE (Date 1 8 2026) EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `is my disease a listed occupational disease if the Seventh Amending Regulation is void as a whole` `Parkinson syndrome` TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE (Date 1 8 2026) EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `is my disease a listed occupational disease if the Seventh Amending Regulation is void as a whole` `Parkinson syndrome` TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE (Date 1 1 2027) EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `is my disease a listed occupational disease if the Seventh Amending Regulation is void as a whole` `another disease` TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE (Date 1 8 2026) EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `does the 2026 preamble cite the power for the new occupational disease`
